<title>UK: Flextech shrs placed by Goldman - traders.</title>
<headline>Flextech shrs placed by Goldman - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>More than nine million shares in Flextech Plc were placed on Friday at 624-1/2, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1050 GMT, the shares were down 44p to 635p on turnover of 9.65 million shares. They were the fourth most heavily traded shares in London.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
